  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4204.04 VOC Content",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4204.04 VOC Content. Each container of any AIM coating subject to this chapter shall display one or more of the following:\n\n(a) The VOC content limit for the applicable coating category from Env-A 4203.01(b), Table 4203-1;\n\n(b) The VOC content of the coating as supplied in grams of VOC per liter of coating, calculated in accordance with Env-A 4206; or\n\n(c) The VOC content of the coating as applied in grams of VOC per liter of coating, when thinned according to the manufacturer’s recommendations, calculated in accordance with Env-A 4206.\n\nSource. #8695, eff 7-27-06; ss by #10736, eff 1-1-15; ss by #14202, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4200.html"
